  "question": {
    "text": "With the usual notation in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;units and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;units, then the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
